WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.570
-Whenever Donald Trump holds
a press conference,

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.805
his rambling,
nonsensical responses

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.573
raise more questions
than answers,

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:10.043
so we decided to hold another
one right here, right now.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.111
That's right, Donald Trump
and the "Late Night" Press Corps

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:13.913
are here in our studio
and ready to go,

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.449
so without further ado,
it's time for

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:19.218
the "Late Night"
White House Press Conference.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.220
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:26.726
♪♪

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:29.795
Mr. President,
Mr. President, Mr. President.

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:31.598
Mr. President, Mr. President.
Yes, thank you.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:33.800
Seth Meyers,
"Late Night with Seth Meyers."

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.269
Mr. President,
if I had 100 bucks

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:38.538
for every time you lied,
what would happen?

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:41.341
-This whole room would be
filled up with $100 bills.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.046
-What does it say
on your business cards?

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:48.515
-A horrible precedent.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:56.455
-Why didn't Betsy DeVos
and her advisers show up

00:00:56.455 --> 00:00:58.891
at your last meeting with
the Department of Education?

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:00.225
-They didn't know the location,

00:01:00.225 --> 00:01:02.895
they didn't know the time,
they didn't know the year.

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:05.464
They didn't know anything.

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:06.765
-How are your kids doing?

00:01:06.765 --> 00:01:09.068
-They're very good people.
I know many of them.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:12.438
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:15.674
-Mr. President, can you recite
the entire alphabet?

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:17.977
-ABC, CBS, NBC.

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:21.114
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.481
-Mr. President,
what did you whisper

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:23.816
into Stormy Daniels' ear

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.518
when she got in your bed
that night?

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.653
-This is gonna be not good.

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:32.158
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.160
-I heard that Vladimir Putin
poked your tummy

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.395
and gave you a nickname.

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.528
What was it?

00:01:36.528 --> 00:01:38.064
-Mr. Pillsbury.

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:41.266
-Sorry, just for clarity,

00:01:41.266 --> 00:01:43.336
when did you file
for bankruptcy?

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:46.872
-30 years ago, 25 years ago,
10 years ago, 5 years ago.

00:01:46.872 --> 00:01:48.074
-Wow.
That's a lot of, uh --

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:49.175
-Excuse me.
Excuse me.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:50.509
-Oh. I'm sorry.
Go on.

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:52.812
-30 years ago.
36 years ago.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.547
-Okay.
Moving on.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:55.848
Level with me.

00:01:55.848 --> 00:01:57.684
How much do you actually weigh?

00:01:57.684 --> 00:01:59.953
-Five times more than
you ever thought possible.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:02.021
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.023
-I heard Mike Pompeo
was thinking

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:06.092
about opening a clock store.

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.660
What advice did you give him?

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.396
-I said, "Mike, don't get
into the time game."

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.432
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:19.072
-Mr. President,
the Stormy Daniels scandal

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:20.740
has been quite a distraction
for you.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.441
Are you done with porn stars?

00:02:22.441 --> 00:02:24.176
-What do you mean?
I did like five today.

00:02:24.176 --> 00:02:26.846
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.954
-What happened
to all the cholesterol?

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.490
-I think I have it right here.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.991
[ Audience groans, laughs ]

00:02:38.991 --> 00:02:41.994
-President Trump, if I may
get serious for a moment,

00:02:41.994 --> 00:02:43.295
why you still hustlin'?

00:02:43.295 --> 00:02:45.231
-I still love the paper.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.270
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.904
-What do you say to yourself
in the mirror

00:02:51.904 --> 00:02:53.439
every night before bed?

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:56.509
-They weren't laughing at me.
They were laughing with me.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:57.543
-Okay.

00:02:57.543 --> 00:02:59.045
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:02.248
That's a nice --
That's a nice affirmation.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:05.150
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:07.086
What will it say
on your tombstone?

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:09.489
-A big, fat con job.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:13.292
-Well, it looks like
we're out of time, everybody,

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:14.794
So on behalf of the rest
of the "Late Night" Press Corps,

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:16.062
have a good night.

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:18.898
We'll be right back
with Wanda Sykes, everybody.

